{'symbol': 'RCL', 'date': '2022-01-07 16:23:00', 'title': 'ROYAL CARIBBEAN GROUP ANNOUNCES CLOSING OF SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES OFFERING', 'text': 'MIAMI, JAN. 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ROYAL CARIBBEAN GROUP (NYSE: RCL) (THE "COMPANY") TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS CLOSED ITS PRIVATE OFFERING OF $1,000,000,000\xa0AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF 5.375% SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES\xa0DUE 2027\xa0(THE "NOTES").\xa0THE NOTES WILL MATURE ON\xa0JULY 15, 2027\xa0UNLESS EARLIER REDEEMED OR REPURCHASED.'}